WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.280
Emmy was learning to knit.

2
00:00:08.281 --> 00:00:11.528
She had two knitting needles.

3
00:00:11.529 --> 00:00:15.812
She had lots of purple yarn.

4
00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:27.573
But Emmy didn't know what to make.

5
00:00:27.574 --> 00:00:33.179
"Brr," said Aunt Judy one morning.

6
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:37.509
"It's almost winter."

7
00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:40.798
"I know what to make!" thought Emmy.

8
00:00:40.799 --> 00:00:44.959
"I'll make a warm scarf!"

9
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:50.977
Emmy started knitting a purple scarf.

10
00:00:50.978 --> 00:00:53.677
The days got colder.

11
00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:59.295
Emmy kept knitting.

12
00:00:59.296 --> 00:01:05.610
"I'll need this scarf soon," she thought.

13
00:01:05.611 --> 00:01:19.083
Emmy worked fast.

14
00:01:19.084 --> 00:01:21.881
Soon the scarf was done.

15
00:01:21.882 --> 00:01:26.954
"This scarf will be so warm," thought Emmy.

16
00:01:26.955 --> 00:01:31.441
Emmy put on the scarf.

17
00:01:31.442 --> 00:01:35.122
"Oh no!" she moaned.

18
00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:39.880
"My scarf has lots of mistakes!"

19
00:01:39.881 --> 00:01:44.132
"Your scarf is still pretty," said Mom.

20
00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:48.292
"I like the purple yarn," said Dad.

21
00:01:48.293 --> 00:01:52.364
"Well, I don't," said Emmy.

22
00:01:52.365 --> 00:01:57.838
Emmy ran up to her room.

23
00:01:57.839 --> 00:02:03.001
She stuffed the scarf in a drawer.

24
00:02:03.002 --> 00:02:09.718
"I'm never knitting again," thought Emmy.

25
00:02:09.719 --> 00:02:13.650
One morning Oliver looked upset.

26
00:02:13.651 --> 00:02:17.016
His eyes filled with tears.

27
00:02:17.017 --> 00:02:20.833
"What's wrong, Oliver?" asked Emmy.

28
00:02:20.834 --> 00:02:25.298
"It's Purple Day at school," said Oliver.

29
00:02:25.299 --> 00:02:29.358
"But I don't have anything purple to wear."

30
00:02:29.359 --> 00:02:38.620
"Hmm . . ." Emmy ran to her room.

31
00:02:38.621 --> 00:02:41.758
"Here, Oliver," said Emmy.

32
00:02:41.759 --> 00:02:44.216
"You can wear my scarf."

33
00:02:44.217 --> 00:02:47.041
Oliver took Emmy's scarf.

34
00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:50.168
"It's purple!" cried Oliver.

35
00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.502
He put it on.

36
00:02:52.503 --> 00:03:01.667
Emmy smiled. "And it's perfect!"

